{"server":"jp","storyId":"act12d0_level_act12d0_07_beg","groupId":"act12d0","stageId":"act12d0_07","title":"先客","storyCode":"RI-7","avgTag":"戦闘前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"429f0bde11a270b8acb6c2fb946b06ec603f6a01674ecf7cf31c1a470795826e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"ズゥママの部族にて、エンジンを装着したビッグ・アグリーが再び起動する。\nその瞬間、ケオベが一人で部族に乗り込んだ。ズゥママはその相手にと、部下をけしかける。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"のわああああ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"ありゃりゃ、また失敗か。しかし今回はいい角度に飛んでったな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"どこまで吹っ飛ばされたんだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"さぁな。まあどうせすぐ戻ってくるだろ。こっちはこっちで続けようぜ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"さてと、このパイプはどこにつなげば――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"おっ、こんなところに丁度いい挿し口があるな、それ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"おーい、これでどうだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"全然ダメだ。お前本当にできるのかよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"うるせぇ！　こんなエンジン見たことねぇんだ、もっと試させろ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"オレがやってやる！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"オレが見るに、このパイプはここに挿すべきなんだ。それで……このボタンはなんだ？　まあとりあえずポチっとこうぜ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"おめぇこそ適当にやってるだけじゃねぇか！　これはそこじゃなくてこっちに挿すべきなんだよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"このアホ共、いつまでやってんの。というか、オイルパイプすら挿してないの？　もうどいて、アタシがやるから！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"えっーと、オイルパイプってどこに挿すんだっけ……うーん、考えても無駄か。このデカイ挿し口に決まり！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"ねえ、誰か起動してみて！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"帰ったぞーい！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"まったく今の若者は年寄りを敬うことを知らん。誰一人として吹き飛ばされたわしを探しに来んとは……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"だって大祭司様は、どんなに飛ばされてもピンピンして帰ってくるだろ。みんなもう慣れちまったんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"ほらほら、無駄口叩いてないで起動すんぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"わかったわかった。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ビッグ・アグリー","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――――！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"ビッグ・アグリー、愛しの我が子よ、そろそろ起きる時間じゃぞ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"おお！　大族長、やっと動いたぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"なんて綺麗なエンジン音なんだ！　こんなに素晴らしい音は初めて聞いたぜ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"ふふーん、やっぱりアタシのおかげね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"お前たち、一体どうやったんだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"見ての通りだ大族長！　あれで試してみたら動いたんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"このパイプをここに、あのパイプをあそこに挿してみたんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"ええ、ビッグ・アグリーを作り出したときのように！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"よくやった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ、ただのガラクタだったビッグ・アグリーが、こんなにも立派になるとは……高らかに歌いたくなってくるわい！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"あの下手くそな歌をか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"なんじゃと！？　歌の才能はあるつもりだったんじゃが……残念無念じゃ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"いや、もしかしたら、歌い方の問題かもしれん。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"うむ、そうだ、きっとそうに違いない。次はベルカントで歌ってみるぞ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"大族長、誰かが突っ込んできたわ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"ガヴィルか？　ならば私が……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"違うわ！　武器をいっぱい持った変なヤツよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"なんだって？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"ズゥママの部族はこの先のはずです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"あいつ、自分たちの住処をこんな風に改造してんのかよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ブレイズ","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"すごいじゃない！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"あれ、なんだか中が騒がしいですね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"ん？　なんでもう喧嘩になってんだ？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"レユニオンめ、おいらの名前を奪おうとするなんて許さないぞ！　はちみつクッキーより大事なものなんだぞ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"ぐあああああ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"どっから湧いて出たんだこの変なヤツ！　しかも強ぇ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"言葉はわかるけど……「レユニオン」っていったい何のことを言ってるのよ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウタゲ","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"あれっ、この声……ケーちゃんじゃない？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"ですね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ブレイズ","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"この騒ぎ、もう相当暴れてるみたいだね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"とにかく、まずはあいつを大人しくさせるぞ！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"ケーちゃん、もうやめるんだ！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"……","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"ケーちゃん、頑張れ！","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["ブレイズ"]},{"speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","aliases":["ガヴィル"]},{"speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","aliases":["ケオベ"]},{"speakerId":"char_337_utage","aliases":["ウタゲ"]},{"speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","aliases":["トミミ"]},{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["ユーネクテス"]}]}
